{
  "id": "E341",
  "title": "Secret Weapons for Losing Weight",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-07-12",
  "synopsis": "Little Le found some secret weapons for weight loss. Are they really helpful?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1096/1cf2af293113ea197019febaa02d5fe767f2bef7.mp3?1562667270",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "减肥神器\n\n保罗：你不是要减肥吗？怎么又买了这么多零食？\n小乐：你不懂！这些都是天然的蔬菜干和水果干，特别健康，吃不胖的。\n保罗：我看看，芒果干、苹果干、葡萄干、芋头干、红薯干……还真不少！但是你确定吃这么多不会变胖？\n小乐：当然啦，广告里就是这么说的。",
    "traditional": "減肥神器\n\n保羅：你不是要減肥嗎？怎麼又買了這麼多零食？\n小樂：你不懂！這些都是天然的蔬菜乾和水果乾，特別健康，吃不胖的。\n保羅：我看看，芒果乾、蘋果乾、葡萄乾、芋頭乾、紅薯乾……還真不少！但是你確定吃這麼多不會變胖？\n小樂：當然啦，廣告裡就是這麼說的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Secret Weapons for Losing Weight"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：你不是要减肥吗？怎么又买了这么多零食？",
      "traditional": "保羅：你不是要減肥嗎？怎麼又買了這麼多零食？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ bú shì yào jiǎn féi ma zěn me yòu mǎi le zhè me duō líng shí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Didn’t you want to lose weight? How come you bought so many snacks again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：你不懂！",
      "traditional": "小樂：你不懂！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ bù dǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "这些都是天然的蔬菜干和水果干，特别健康，吃不胖的。",
      "traditional": "這些都是天然的蔬菜乾和水果乾，特別健康，吃不胖的。",
      "pinyin": "zhè xiē dōu shì tiān rán de shū cài gān hé shuǐ guǒ gān tè bié jiàn kāng chī bú pàng de",
      "english": "Little Le: You don't understand!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "All of these are natural dried vegetables and dried fruits, which are especially healthy, and not fattening to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "保罗：我看看，芒果干、苹果干、葡萄干、芋头干、红薯干……还真不少！",
      "traditional": "保羅：我看看，芒果乾、蘋果乾、葡萄乾、芋頭乾、紅薯乾……還真不少！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ kàn kan máng guǒ gān píng guǒ gān pú tao gān yù tou gān hóng shǔ gān hái zhēn bù shǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "但是你确定吃这么多不会变胖？",
      "traditional": "但是你確定吃這麼多不會變胖？",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì nǐ què dìng chī zhè me duō bú huì biàn pàng",
      "english": "Paul: Let me see, dried mango, dried apples, dried raisins, dried taros, dried sweet potatoes... Still quite a lot!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But are you sure you won’t get fat eating this much?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：当然啦，广告里就是这么说的。",
      "traditional": "小樂：當然啦，廣告裡就是這麼說的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè dāng rán la guǎng gào lǐ jiù shì zhè me shuō de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Of course, that’s what it said in the advertisement."
    }
  ],
